## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cff0091edNaowh|r Forever: |cff0cd29fEllesmereUI|r Skin
## Notes: Paints Naowh Forever's windows, buttons, borders and text with the EllesmereUI theme. Disable to go back to Naowh's own look.
## Author: local
## Version: 2.1.13
## Dependencies: EllesmereUI
## OptionalDeps: EllesmereUIBlizzardSkin, EllesmereUIFriends, EllesmereUIActionBars, EllesmereUIBags
## SavedVariables: NaowhEllesmereSkinDB

# This folder name sorts before "NaowhForever" on purpose: the skin has to be listening when Naowh
# Forever finishes loading, before any of its modules build a frame. Do not add NaowhForever as a
# dependency, or it would load first and the hook would come too late.

Core\Namespace.lua
Core\Config.lua
Core\Utils.lua
NaowhEllesmereSkin.lua
Skins\Auras.lua
Options\Settings.lua
Core\Init.lua
